# Second automap script of the software renderer (issue #246, third round): the rules of the game that the first one does not reach.
# MAP15 (the whole map is drawn without a cheat)
hold 30 forward 25
hold 25 forward 25 turn 4
key 9
hold 3
shot 1
hold 25 forward 25 turn -3
shot 3
# topo once: the cheat of the lines (secret doors, teleporters, locked doors, floor and ceiling steps)
key 116
hold 2
key 111
hold 2
key 112
hold 2
key 111
hold 2
hold 3
shot 4
hold 30 forward 25 turn 2
shot 5
# topo again: the things
key 116
hold 2
key 111
hold 2
key 112
hold 2
key 111
hold 2
hold 3
shot 6
# big: the whole level
key 111
hold 3
shot 7
key 111
hold 3
# rotate on, follow
key 114
hold 3
hold 30 forward 25 turn 3
shot 8
# TAB: overlay, then off
key 9
hold 3
shot 9
key 9
hold 3
hold 20 forward 25 turn 2
